# .hygiene-terms — words that must not appear in this PUBLIC repo's DOCS.
#
# Scanned by scripts/hygiene-check.sh in *.md and *.txt files ONLY — never in
# index.html / JS / server code, where words like "price" are legitimate app data.
# One Perl regex per line, matched case-insensitively. Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored. This file itself is not scanned.
#
# A hit fails CI before anything deploys. If a hit is legitimate engineering
# text, reword the doc or narrow the regex below (and say why in CLAUDE.md) —
# don't delete the protection.

\bsponsor                 # sponsor, sponsors, sponsorship
95\s*/\s*5                # a 95/5 split
gift[\s-]+split
\bad[\s-]+inventory
monetiz                   # monetize, monetization
monetis                   # monetise, monetisation
\binvestors?\b
business[\s-]+plan
go[\s-]+to[\s-]+market
pitch[\s-]+deck
\bvaluations?\b           # word-bounded so "evaluation" doesn't trip
pricing[\s-]+tiers?
revenue[\s-]+shar(?:e|ing)
